Requirements:
- REST `POST /api/v1/topology/hot_update`: submit a set of edge/station mutations (temporary construction zone, one-way toggle, new marker/station) → atomic validation of connectivity → in-flight safety arbitration → atomic persist → hot effective.
- REST `POST /api/v1/topology/block_edge`: temporary block (can reuse existing `/v2/block_station_route`, but "in-flight vehicle safety": current Block just takes the lock; it does NOT reroute in-flight vehicles; the deadlock tick would eventually reroute, but the requirement says verify in-flight vehicle safety at apply time).

